        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Édouard Roger-Vasselin, Javier Frana\n- Events: 1990 Thriftway ATP Championships – Singles\n- Topics: Tennis tournament outcomes, title counts\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1990 Thriftway ATP Championships – Singles, Javier Frana defeated Édouard Roger-Vasselin.\n- Javier Frana won eight career events.\n- Édouard Roger-Vasselin won two career events.\n- Javier Frana won more events than Édouard Roger-Vasselin.",
